sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant WebSocket as WebSocket Bridge
    participant Realtime as OpenAI Realtime API
    participant Guard as AI Intent Guard
    participant Router as Integration Router
    participant Adapter as Domain Adapter
    participant Core as Core System API

    Caller->>WebSocket: Audio stream
    WebSocket->>Realtime: Forward audio
    Realtime->>WebSocket: Transcription
    WebSocket->>Guard: Classify intent
    Guard->>Guard: Gen AI classification
    Guard-->>WebSocket: In scope ✓

    Realtime->>WebSocket: Tool call (e.g. get_balance)
    WebSocket->>Router: execute_tool(domain, tool, args)
    Router->>Router: Check circuit breaker
    Router->>Adapter: execute_tool(tool, args)
    Adapter->>Core: HTTP API call
    Core-->>Adapter: JSON response
    Adapter-->>Router: AdapterResponse
    Router-->>WebSocket: Tool result
    WebSocket->>Realtime: function_call_output
    Realtime->>WebSocket: AI voice response
    WebSocket->>Caller: Audio response

    Note over Router: On failure: retry up to N times
    Note over Router: After N failures: circuit breaker opens
    Note over Guard: Falls back to keyword matching if AI unavailable
